    "growth_divergence_warning": "Equity CAGR is negative (losses and buybacks shrink book) and EPS/owner-FCF are negative at the start points, so CAGRs on them are undefined. Revenue is flat over 5 years (FY21 867 -> FY26 819) with a FY22 spike to 1,237 and a reset in FY23. Selected rate is the 3yr revenue CAGR; forward base growth (10% decelerating) leans on FY26's +14.6% and is a judgment, not the historical rate.",
